The robustness2 policy and null descriptor implementation in ../robustness2.c,
../null_descriptors.c and ../null_map.h are also adapted from MaliBridge commit
95a1e600a51299294e06bb09db2db8cc509fe6a3 (server/server_emu.c,
server/server_instance.c, server/server_nulldesc.c and server/nd_map.h), under
GPL-3.0-or-later. They are compatibility approximations, not conformance claims.

The specialization-composite normalization in ../spirv_mali.c is adapted from
MaliBridge server/server_spvfix.c at the same 95a1e600 commit and the proposed
port in taowen/libhybris PR #2. Copyright (C) 2026 ASEbrahim and MaliBridge
contributors, GPL-3.0-or-later. Integration and diagnostics are modified here.

The first-viewport approximation in ../multiviewport.c and the viewport/scissor
clamps in ../shader_dispatch.c and ../../layer/commands.c are adapted from
MaliBridge server/server_emu_compat.c and client/emu.c at the same 95a1e600
commit. Copyright (C) 2026 ASEbrahim and MaliBridge contributors, GPL-3.0-or-later.
Integration and diagnostics are modified here. This is not full multiViewport.

The indirect multi-draw splitter in ../multidraw.c follows server/server_emu_compat.c,
server/server_emu.c and client/emu.c at the same 95a1e600 commit.
Copyright (C) 2026 ASEbrahim and MaliBridge contributors, GPL-3.0-or-later.
Integration and diagnostics are modified here. Shader DrawIndex is not emulated.

The dual-source blend approximation in ../dual_source.c and its pipeline
integration follow server/server_emu_compat.c and server/server_emu_shader.c
at the same 95a1e600 commit. Copyright (C) 2026 ASEbrahim and MaliBridge
contributors, GPL-3.0-or-later. Integration and diagnostics are modified here.
Source-one blending is approximated by source zero, not fully emulated.
